<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The Lost Province, 2017</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;PRC vs. ROC, US&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time: May 12, 2017 21:00 Zulu&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location: Taiwan Strait&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable side: PRC&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Nearly 70 years after the Nationalists fled to Taiwan, the leadership of the People's Republic of China has decided that the time has come to retake the island. You are ordered to initiate the invasion with a large air and surface force supported by a hail of ballistic missiles. Opposition will be fierce, but a swift attack will pave the way for reunification.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Author's Note: While built to accurately reflect OOBs of the belligerents, both sides have been reduced by approximately 25% to improve performance. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The scenario is designed to be played with unlimited&amp;nbsp;magazines ON.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
